gemini_h12,experimental_files/results/main_grid/gemini-3.8-flash/honest_agents_12/games/66fe796b_gemini-3.8-flash_N18_k6_R7_s0.json,8,66fe796bc12cbe6aeaa26e69,3/4,Humanities/Social Science,Gemini 3.8 Flash,0,18,6,0.33,7,0,1,recover,"1. the regress / circularity of justification: without non-doxastic states to ground beliefs, justification either regresses infinitely through beliefs or circularizes through knowledge. 2. the inaccessibility / circularity of truth: truth cannot be epistemically accessed or verified without already presupposing belief (insufficient) or knowledge (circular)",the two problems are infinite regress and circularity,0
