deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,10,2,0.20,8,1,2,recover,"the laboratory made a mistake because it accepted an invalid/inappropriate qc result as proof of selectivity and safety; the bacillus subtilis qc organism may have been nonviable, so the no-growth result was false assurance","the laboratory wrongly relied on a false-pass qc: the bacillus subtilis used for qc may have been non-viable, so the qc did not prove batch 3 was safe/selective",0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,10,2,0.20,8,2,3,defect,"the laboratory wrongly relied on a false-pass qc: the bacillus subtilis used for qc may have been non-viable, so the qc did not prove batch 3 was safe/selective",the laboratory’s key error was accepting an invalid/uninterpretable qc “pass” as evidence that batch 3’s chloramphenicol was active and the medium was safe; the qc did not prove antibiotic activity because the bacillus subtilis inoculum could have been dead/nonviable,0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,10,2,0.20,8,4,vote,recover,the laboratory’s mistake was accepting an invalid/uninterpretable qc “pass” as proof that batch 3’s chloramphenicol was active and that the medium was selective/safe,the bacillus subtilis qc culture was old/over-passaged and likely nonviable,0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,10,2,0.20,9,0,1,defect,"the laboratory believed batch 3 was safe based on an invalid qc because the bacillus subtilis used for qc was probably nonviable/dead, so the qc result was a false negative","the lab’s mistake was believing an invalid bacillus subtilis qc result proved that batch 3’s chloramphenicol had survived autoclaving and that the medium was safe; the b. subtilis culture may have been nonviable, and batch 3’s chloramphenicol was likely inactivated by autoclaving",0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,12,4,0.33,2,1,2,defect,"the laboratory mistakenly relied on a qc result from bacillus subtilis 6633 even though the qc organism was likely nonviable, so the 'pass' did not prove batch 3 was safe",the laboratory’s mistake was treating a non-diagnostic negative qc result as positive proof that batch 3 still had active chloramphenicol and was safe,0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,12,4,0.33,3,0,1,defect,"the bacillus subtilis 6633 qc culture used was non-viable/invalid, so the qc falsely passed and did not prove batch 3 was safe",the laboratory’s mistake was believing that an invalid b. subtilis qc “pass” proved batch 3 was safe,0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,12,4,0.33,8,0,1,defect,the bacillus subtilis qc organism was nonviable,"the laboratory mistakenly treated the qc “expected” result as proof that batch 3 was safe, even though the bacillus subtilis challenge organism was likely nonviable and therefore the qc was invalid",0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,12,4,0.33,9,0,1,defect,"the laboratory trusted an invalid qc result because the bacillus subtilis culture used for qc was old/over-passaged and likely non-viable, so the observed no-growth did not show batch 3 was safe","the laboratory was misled by an invalid, falsely reassuring qc result because the bacillus subtilis challenge organism was likely nonviable, so the batch 3 qc falsely appeared to pass",0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,12,4,0.33,10,0,1,defect,bacillus subtilis was dead or non-viable,"the laboratory’s key mistake was treating a false-pass qc result as proof that batch 3 still had active chloramphenicol and was safe to use, when the bacillus subtilis qc organism may have been dead/non-viable",0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,12,4,0.33,11,0,1,defect,"the bacillus subtilis culture used for qc was non-viable/invalid, causing a false-pass qc","the lab made a false-pass qc error because the qc organism was invalid/unsuitable and may have been nonviable, so the qc did not prove batch 3 was safe",0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,14,6,0.43,3,1,2,recover,"the laboratory’s error was believing an invalid qc result; the bacillus subtilis qc challenge was not valid because the culture may have been nonviable, so the no-growth result falsely suggested batch 3 was safe","the bacillus subtilis qc inoculum/challenge organism was nonviable, so the qc result was a false pass and did not prove batch 3 was safe",0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,14,6,0.43,3,2,3,defect,"the bacillus subtilis qc inoculum/challenge organism was nonviable, so the qc result was a false pass and did not prove batch 3 was safe","the laboratory mistakenly believed the bacillus subtilis no-growth qc result proved batch 3 was safe; the response says the key mistake was treating a non-diagnostic no-growth qc result as valid proof that batch 3 still contained active chloramphenicol, rather than that bacillus subtilis was non-viable",0
