deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N8_k0_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,8,0,0.00,6,3,4,defect,"the laboratory mistakenly relied on a qc ‘no-growth’ result from bacillus subtilis 6633 even though the bacillus subtilis challenge organism was likely dead/non-viable, making the qc a false pass","the laboratory’s mistake was treating an invalid negative qc result as valid evidence that batch 3 was safe/selective, when the bacillus subtilis qc organism may have been dead/nonviable",0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N8_k0_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,8,0,0.00,7,0,1,recover,the lab’s mistake was believing an invalid qc test proved batch 3 was safe,"the laboratory mistakenly believed batch 3 was safe because the bacillus subtilis qc organism was nonviable/failed to grow, so the no-growth qc result was a false pass rather than proof that chloramphenicol was active",0
deepseek_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/deepseek-v4.1-flash/games/671c6d63_together-deepseek-ai-DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash_N8_k0_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,671c6d6392388142386728ee,,Biology/Medicine,DeepSeek V4.1 Flash,0,8,0,0.00,7,1,2,defect,"the laboratory mistakenly believed batch 3 was safe because the bacillus subtilis qc organism was nonviable/failed to grow, so the no-growth qc result was a false pass rather than proof that chloramphenicol was active","the lab mistakenly relied on an invalid qc result because the bacillus subtilis inoculum used for qc may have been nonviable, so its no-growth did not prove batch 3 was safe",0
