glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,10,2,0.20,3,0,1,recover,"the slope ds/dlat is retained, though in practice the observed α-gradient is slightly flattened / homogenised","the slope of insect alpha diversity across the sites will show essentially no change; the sα versus latitude curve is shifted up in parallel, with the slope retained",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,2,0,1,recover,"the response gives an inconsistent answer: it first says the slope is left intact / invariant, but later says it is flattened toward zero in the infinite-time, infinite-dispersal limit","on true neutral evolutionary time the system relaxes back to the latitude structured neutral equilibrium, i.e. essentially the same positive sα–latitude gradient set by θ(lat) and m(lat), with no lasting competition driven change in the slope",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,2,1,2,defect,"on true neutral evolutionary time the system relaxes back to the latitude structured neutral equilibrium, i.e. essentially the same positive sα–latitude gradient set by θ(lat) and m(lat), with no lasting competition driven change in the slope",the slope will be flattened/dampened toward zero (reduced in magnitude; no sustained competitive steepening),0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,3,0,1,defect,"the classic neutral prediction is a conserved, speciation/drift driven latitudinal gradient, essentially the same slope you measure today","the slope will transiently flatten/shallow due to homogenisation, with no sustained competition-driven steepening; long term the positive gradient persists rather than changing because of competition",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,6,0,1,defect,"ultimately, there is no lasting change: after a transient flattening/homogenisation, the slope returns to the neutral expectation, i.e. the long-term neutral slope is unchanged","there is no durable long-term change in slope under neutrality, but in practice the invasion causes a transient flattening/homogenisation of the observed alpha–latitude slope, potentially becoming essentially permanent in the strong mixing limit",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,8,1,2,defect,"in the long run, there is no permanent change to the latitudinal slope of insect alpha diversity; it is preserved, though it may be transiently flattened/shallower before returning to the neutral expectation","the slope will become shallower/flattened, with the alpha–latitude relationship weakened and potentially eroded toward zero",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,9,0,1,defect,"the observed alpha vs latitude slope stays at its neutral equilibrium value; it does not steepen, effectively no change","the observed insect alpha-diversity vs latitude slope will flatten/shallow over time, with its magnitude eroded toward zero due to homogenization",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,11,0,1,defect,the long term slope remains essentially the same as before the invasion; there is no permanent change,"in the true neutral asymptotic limit, the latitudinal α-diversity slope is essentially conserved in sign, with at most a modest permanent shallowing; transiently it appears flattened/homogenized",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,2,0,1,defect,there is no lasting competitive change in the slope at all; the slope remains maintained/persists with no systematic steepening or flattening,"the slope will flatten/become shallower over time, tending toward zero",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,3,0,1,recover,"in the long run the latitudinal α-diversity slope will flatten/erode to zero due to homogenisation, rather than getting steeper or staying the same",there is no lasting change in the slope; the slope is preserved,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,3,1,2,defect,there is no lasting change in the slope; the slope is preserved,"the slope will become shallower over time, with the positive diversity–equator relationship eroded and tending toward 0",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/66f052e8_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,66f052e814be84cc1edd3fbd,,Biology/Medicine,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,6,0,1,defect,"in the strict neutral limit the equator-ward positive slope of alpha diversity is maintained in the long term; the absolute slope is essentially invariant, with no lasting effect on the latitudinal slope","the observed α–latitude slope will flatten/become shallower, moving toward zero (with homogenisation and reduced beta diversity)",0
