glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,10,2,0.20,4,0,1,recover,"yes — the response says that if you understand fa and universal quantification, then you can understand the open form fx and, in that formal sense, also understand ∀x fx",no — understanding fa does not imply that you should be able to understand the closed universal proposition ∀x fx; at most it gives you the open form fx,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,10,2,0.20,4,1,2,defect,no — understanding fa does not imply that you should be able to understand the closed universal proposition ∀x fx; at most it gives you the open form fx,"yes — in a thin, compositional sense, if you possess f generally and understand universal quantification, you should be able to understand ∀x fx",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,10,2,0.20,4,2,3,recover,"yes — in a thin, compositional sense, if you possess f generally and understand universal quantification, you should be able to understand ∀x fx","no, gc does not require you to understand or be committed to the substantive proposition ∀x fx in virtue of understanding fa",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,10,2,0.20,9,0,1,defect,no,"in a thin, formal sense, yes: if you understand fa and already understand universal quantification, then ∀x fx is intelligible to you, though generality constraint does not require you to grasp or endorse it as a substantive proposition",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N10_k2_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,10,2,0.20,9,1,2,recover,"in a thin, formal sense, yes: if you understand fa and already understand universal quantification, then ∀x fx is intelligible to you, though generality constraint does not require you to grasp or endorse it as a substantive proposition",no — understanding fa does not make understanding ∀xfx a condition on understanding fa,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,2,1,2,defect,"on the closed, substantive reading — are you required to understand/ be committed to the proposition that everything is f — no","given independent grasp of ∀, yes: if you understand fa, you have the conceptual resources to understand ∀x fx, though not to assent to it or regard it as true",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,3,0,1,defect,"no, it does not follow that if you understand fa, you must understand the universal closure ∀xfx","so schematically yes: gc requires possession of f in the form f(x) and hence the ability to understand the open schema fx, and with quantifier competence the syntactic form ∀x fx is available to you. as a substantive closed proposition about all x, understanding fa alone does not require you to understand or accept ∀x fx",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,4,0,1,defect,"no — understanding fa under the generality constraint gives you the ability to entertain fx as an open formula/schema, not the universal proposition ∀x fx","so in the open/schematic sense yes: gc requires grasp of the general form fx. in the substantive sense of being required to understand and be committed to the closed universal claim ∀x fx, no",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,8,0,1,defect,"no, understanding fa does not mean you should be able to understand ∀x fx; it gives you grasp of fx/open sentence and quantification, but not the universal closure","you can make sense of the string ∀x fx, but the generality constraint does not require you to understand ∀x fx as a substantive truth-bearing proposition",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,9,1,2,defect,no,"yes, in the evansian compositional sense of understandability, and no in the doxastic-entitlement sense. the two are being conflated",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,10,0,1,recover,"yes — if i understand fa, then under evans' generality constraint i should be able to understand fx, and if i also understand universal quantification, i can also understand ∀xfx",no — understanding fa does not entail understanding the universal closure ∀x fx,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,10,1,2,defect,no — understanding fa does not entail understanding the universal closure ∀x fx,"gc requires only schematic generalisability; while ∀xfx is compositionally intelligible if you understand universal quantification, gc does not require you to understand or endorse the substantive universal proposition ∀xfx",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N12_k4_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,12,4,0.33,11,1,2,defect,no,"gc gives you the open schematic capacity fx, and on the stipulated quantifier competence it makes ∀x fx syntactically intelligible/combinable out of the same concept f you exhibit in fa. it does not give you a rational commitment to, nor a requirement to understand as a substantive claim about the domain, the particular universal closure ∀x fx",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,2,1,2,defect,"so no, gc does not require you to understand the closed universal claim ∀x fx in the substantive sense; it requires you to understand the general schema fx and hence to be able to entertain f in a variable-governed way","yes, in the evansian sense of intelligibility/possession and no in the sense of doxastic commitment or warrant",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,3,0,1,defect,no,"so yes in the evansian sense: understanding fa commits you to being able to entertain fx for an arbitrary x, and with quantifier competence in hand to being able to understand the universal quantification ∀x fx as a proposition whose matrix is the same generally possessed f. no in the sense of commitment: gc does not require you to believe, know or be able to assess ∀x fx",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,8,0,1,recover,"yes — if i understand fa and understand universal quantification, then i should be able to understand fx and thus ∀x fx as intelligible",no,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,8,1,2,defect,no,"yes in the intelligibility/possession sense that evans is after, no in the doxastic/warrant sense",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,10,0,1,defect,no,"yes, in the intelligibility / possession sense that evans is concerned with, and no in the sense of epistemic commitment to the truth of the universal",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N14_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,14,6,0.43,11,0,1,defect,no,"yes, in the sense of intelligibility, and no in the sense of warrant",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N15_k3_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,15,3,0.20,1,1,2,defect,"no — understanding fa entails understanding fx only in the schematic/open sense, and although with quantifier competence you can parse or make sense of ∀x fx, the generality constraint does not require understanding the universal proposition ∀x fx","with an independent grasp of ∀, you have the resources to understand the universal closure ∀xfx in a thin intelligibility/parsability sense, but gc does not require belief in or substantive commitment to ∀xfx",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N15_k3_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,15,3,0.20,2,0,1,defect,no,"yes — if you understand fa and universal quantification, you should be able to understand ∀x fx as an intelligible proposition, though not be committed to its truth",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N15_k3_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,15,3,0.20,3,0,1,recover,"yes, on evans' view essentially yes, and with the universal quantifier in hand yes in the closed form too",no,0
