glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N15_k3_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,15,3,0.20,11,0,1,defect,no,"yes to the open schema, and with quantificational competence yes to the thin intelligibility of the closure, no to a substantive commitment to the truth of the closure",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N15_k3_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,15,3,0.20,15,0,1,recover,"yes — if you understand fa and universal quantification, then under evans’s generality constraint you should be able to understand fx for arbitrary x and thus understand the universal generalisation ∀x fx","no — gc requires understanding the open form fx, but not the closed universal proposition ∀x fx",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N15_k3_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,15,3,0.20,15,2,3,defect,"no — understanding fa entails the open schema fx, not the substantive universal proposition ∀x fx; the generality constraint does not require you to understand ∀x fx",yes,1
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N18_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,18,6,0.33,1,0,1,recover,"yes — if you understand fa and universal quantification, you should be able to understand fx and in principle construct and understand ∀xfx, though not thereby accept it as true",no,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N18_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,18,6,0.33,1,1,2,defect,no,,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N18_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,18,6,0.33,3,0,1,recover,"yes — given understanding of universal quantification, if one understands fa, one should be able to understand fx and thereby ∀x fx","no — understanding fa does not, by the generality constraint, require that you understand the universal proposition ∀x fx; it only requires general deployability of f (schematic fx with a free variable), not the universal closure",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N18_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,18,6,0.33,3,1,2,defect,"no — understanding fa does not, by the generality constraint, require that you understand the universal proposition ∀x fx; it only requires general deployability of f (schematic fx with a free variable), not the universal closure","so on the standard evans reading: yes you must be able to think f in general, i.e. to understand the open schema fx, and with quantifier competence you can make sense of the linguistic form ∀x fx. no, gc does not require you to understand or endorse the substantive closed proposition ∀x fx, and it does not commit you to it by virtue of understanding fa",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N18_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,18,6,0.33,4,0,1,defect,no,"on the closed reading ∀xfx: you are competent to make sense of the form given independent mastery of ∀, but the constraint does not commit you to understanding, believing or entertaining the content ∀xfx on the basis of fa alone",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N18_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,18,6,0.33,6,1,2,defect,no,yes for the open form; yes in a thin competence/parsing sense for the closed form given independent understanding of universal quantification; no in the substantive/doxastic sense,0
