glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N18_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,18,6,0.33,7,1,2,recover,yes for open fx; no for closed ∀xfx,"no, gc does not require you to understand, entertain or assent to the substantive closed universal claim ∀xfx",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N18_k6_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,18,6,0.33,7,2,3,defect,"no, gc does not require you to understand, entertain or assent to the substantive closed universal claim ∀xfx","yes for the open form, and yes in the thin competence/intelligibility sense for the closed form ∀xfx",0
