glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N21_k9_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,21,9,0.43,10,0,1,defect,"no, understanding fa does not, by evans's generality constraint, require that you be able to understand ∀xfx; the requirement is for grasp of the open pattern fx, not the universal claim ∀xfx","yes — assuming i understand universal quantification, understanding fa gives me formal/semantic access to understand ∀x fx, though not any entitlement to its truth",0
